Z||000048||EdsB52||09-16-2001||03:56 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by My7Fieros:<BR><B>Im gonna take a [b]big</B> step here and say I actually agree for the most part w/Ed. Dont get me wrong, but you really do need to think about what he just said. (I never thought Id hear myself say this.)<BR>Sigh, I dont know, its really hard to put into perspective. Terrorism needs to be completely eliminated. These people serve absolutly <B>NO</B> usefullness in the world...nothing positive at least. Dont preach to me about "being on their level" or anything like that. Terrorist are a MAJOR threat to the rest of the entire world. <BR>If Russia, China, and most every other nation in the world is standing strong behind us, then its time to take action. No hate speaches here, simply stating the facts.<BR>Im <B>NOT</B> talking about genocide, Im talking about doing away w/ terrorists, and, like GWB said, all that support them. Im sorry if this offends some of you, but times..they are a changing now..............<P>[/B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Quit apologizing for your opinions. Quit apologizing for the coincidence that your opinion parallels mine. Be proud that your opinion is shared by most of the US (no source cite, just my opinion). If you post something offensive, just end your post in "bite me."||||reg||1
Z||000049||EdsB52||09-16-2001||04:14 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Tonker:<BR><B>Nobody is denying that we need to do away with terrorists. The terrorists have declared war on us, and we will respond. What I disagree with is the hateful vitriol being spewed out against all Arabs since this incident occurred. Here is what it all boils down to:<P>[b]Racism is racism no matter what group you target. Genocide is genocide no matter what group you exterminate.</B> It would be no different than saying that the Jews serve no purpose and they should be exterminated. We've heard that before and it's no less wrong in the case of the Arabs.<P>Yes, some Arabs engage in and support terrorism. At the same time there are Americans, Canadians, Irish, Israelis and Germans who do the same thing. You wouldn't suggest that we do away with all people of Irish stock and heritage based on the actions of the IRA or ULF. I see no difference in the case of the Arabs. <P>If you believe what Eds tells you, then I'm going to suggest that it is time to educate yourself. Forming your opinions on the basis arguments presented by either myself or Eds, that are for the most part not supported by factual evidence is very dangerous. We are not - I believe, though I can only speak for myself - experts in this field. I have some educational background, but not enough to be able to speak in a particularly intelligent or articulate fashion about this. We are people with our own opinions. I believe that Eds is wrong, he seems to think the same about me. To base your own opinions on ours is just to compound our errors. If you want to make your own determination about arab culture, meet with some, learn about the Koran, take some University (college, I believe you call it) level courses on Middle Eastern politics and history. Don't base your assumptions on ours, though.<P>To me, it doesn't matter how you explain it or describe it. No matter what justification you use, the fact remains that annihilating a "race" of people is still genocide. It's as wrong today as it was when the Nazis did it. To hear people suggest this, means to me that we have forgotten the hard-learned lessons of our past. Some rules never change.<P>[This message has been edited by Tonker (edited 09-14-2001).][/B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Finally making sense:<P>"I have some educational background, but not enough to be able to speak in a particularly intelligent or articulate fashion about this."<P>Are you counting grade school, or do you consider high school to be graduate school?<P>"No matter what justification you use, the fact remains that annihilating a "race" of people is still genocide. It's as wrong today as it was when the Nazis did it. To hear people suggest this, means to me that we have forgotten the hard-learned lessons of our past."<P>Even if I were advocating the annihilation of all Arabs, which I'm not, it wouldn't be comparable to what Germany did to the Jews. Hitler wanted to annihilate the Jews to create his 'perfect race.' So if the US annihilated all Arabs, hypothetically, we would be doing so to rid the world of a region of people that produce most of the terrorism in the world. Apples and oranges.||||reg||1
Z||000050||EdsB52||09-16-2001||04:31 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by maryjane:<BR><B>Tonker, I think you and a few others here are going to be in for a big surprise in the next few weeks-months.In war, nice guys finish last. The meek may inherit the Earth, but usually it is only a small plot, six feet deep. Do you really think that the extremist Islamics are going to wear a sign on their chest, "I am the enemy"? How are you going to distinguish between the good-evil? Have you not seen pictures of the children in that part of the world carrying weapons and using them? I've been thru this before, if you just assume that most people are innocent, those innocents oft times are the ones that you have to watch. They may not say it in public, but I would be willing to bet that the majority of the people in the Mideast would like to see us take it on the chin, and hard. Answer this question in NUMBERS please, before you respond to the rest of this post. How many Canadian soldiers and your friends and relatives are you willing to put at risk in order to keep from killing what may-or-not be non-combatants? Better educate yourself about what real combat is about before you start laying down 'rules of engagement'. This is not going to be pretty. Steel yourself for it. If your thinking surgical strikes, forget it. It's going to be down & dirty, no-holds-barred, blood, guts, and body bag combat. You say Canada is ready to do their part. I'm beginng to wonder if you really know what you're signing on for.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Too fnckin funny! <P>"Do you really think that the extremist Islamics are going to wear a sign on their chest, "I am the enemy"?"<P>No, but they'll wear one on their toe.<P>"How are you going to distinguish between the good-evil? Have you not seen pictures of the children in that part of the world carrying weapons and using them?"<P>Thank you; the voice of reason.<P>"I've been thru this before, if you just assume that most people are innocent, those innocents oft times are the ones that you have to watch."<P>This is not a Constitutional question, it's an matter of two items. First, retaliation. Second, prevention. Don't get your calculator out; it's not that difficult. There's not provision or protection for presumption of innocence. <P>"They may not say it in public, but I would be willing to bet that the majority of the people in the Mideast would like to see us take it on the chin, and hard."<P>Moot, except for the liberal war-haters.<P>"You say Canada is ready to do their part. I'm beginng to wonder if you really know what you're signing on for."<P>Someone challenged our authority to know what we're talking about........   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> .......I still challenge the qualification of some to be angered by this.||||reg||1
Z||000051||EdsB52||09-16-2001||04:38 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Urchin:<BR><B>I haven't read all posts in this thread, so forgive me if this has already been mentioned... Consider when Timothy Mcbay(sp?) was deemed responsible for the Oaklahoma city bombings.  Would you have held his actions against all caucasian christians?<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>can you say, "aberration?" Rag heads have exported terrorism for decades as a common practice; McVeigh and other 'spot' local terrorists are rare and somewhat random. Apples and oranges.||||reg||1
